Configuration Management

Deployment --> Downtime
===========================
1. Stop the application
2. Take backup and remove old code
3. Download New code
4. Install dependencies
5. Start the application


PUSH vs PULL
=============
Push --> Ansible is popular and it recently implemented Pull too. (Event Driven)
Pull --> Chef (Polling/Pushing)

Ansible uses YAML script
SSH is available by default, no need to separately configure


